    {
      "source": "<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.x/javadoc-api/org/springframework/context/Lifecycle.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.context\"><code>Lifecycle</code></a> for a <code>HikariDataSource</code> allowing it to participate in\ncheckpoint-restore. When <a href=\"#stop()\"><code>stopped</code></a>, and the data source\n<code>allows it</code>, its pool is suspended,\nblocking any attempts to borrow connections. Open and idle connections are then\nevicted. When subsequently <a href=\"#start()\"><code>started</code></a>, the pool is\n<code>resumed</code> if necessary.",
      "translation": "",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Creates a new <code>HikariCheckpointRestoreLifecycle</code> that will allow the given\n<code>dataSource</code> to participate in checkpoint-restore. The <code>dataSource</code> is\n<a href=\"DataSourceUnwrapper.html#unwrap(javax.sql.DataSource,java.lang.Class,java.lang.Class)\"><code>unwrapped</code></a> to a <code>HikariDataSource</code>. If such\nunwrapping is not possible, the lifecycle will have no effect.",
      "translation": "",
      "count": 2
    },
